        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Tarik $\\overline { { A D } }$ melalui titik $O ,$ membelah α menjadi $\\alpha = \\alpha _ { 1 } + \\alpha _ { 2 }$",
        "bbox": [
            176,
            296,
            699,
            317
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Dengan cara yang sama dengan",
        "bbox": [
            176,
            328,
            442,
            349
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/4f517a30e319df12cb4504c7b10b3c3547a12dcac68bc05ed4da85d9eb218ed9.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\beta _ { 1 } = 2 \\alpha _ { 1 }\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            491,
            329,
            585,
            349
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
